From: Moraxyc <i@qaq.li>
Subject: [PATCH] hdaccess.c: include <libgen.h> for basename() on musl

musl declares basename() only in <libgen.h>, not in <string.h>.

--- a/src/hdaccess.c
+++ b/src/hdaccess.c
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@
 #ifdef HAVE_SYS_STAT_H
 #include <sys/stat.h>
 #endif
+#include <libgen.h>
 #ifdef HAVE_UNISTD_H
 #include <unistd.h>
 #endif
